Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to change the world, start off by making your bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.76,0:00:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If you make your bed every morning, you will have accomplished the first task of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.28,0:00:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It will give you a small sense of pride, and it will encourage you to do another task,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.20,0:00:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,and another, and another.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.64,0:00:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And by the end of the day, that one task completed will have turned into many tasks completed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.48,0:00:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And your bed will also reinforce the fact that the little things in life matter.